WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.248
Bird was reading a book.

2
00:00:10.249 --> 00:00:15.069
The book was about a penguin.

3
00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:19.895
The penguin found a bottle on the beach.

4
00:00:19.896 --> 00:00:22.714
The bottle had a note inside.

5
00:00:22.715 --> 00:00:25.431
"Wow," thought Bird.

6
00:00:25.432 --> 00:00:28.730
"I wonder what the note says."

7
00:00:28.731 --> 00:00:30.506
Bird read some more.

8
00:00:30.507 --> 00:00:33.123
The penguin in the book read the note.

9
00:00:33.124 --> 00:00:36.357
It said: I'm trapped on an island.

10
00:00:36.358 --> 00:00:38.325
Please send help!

11
00:00:38.326 --> 00:00:43.745
"This book is so good!" said Bird.

12
00:00:43.746 --> 00:00:53.451
Later Bird was at the pond.

13
00:00:53.452 --> 00:00:59.117
She saw a bottle near the water.

14
00:00:59.118 --> 00:01:02.224
"I have an idea," thought Bird.

15
00:01:02.225 --> 00:01:05.553
"I will put a note in this bottle.

16
00:01:05.554 --> 00:01:15.913
Maybe someone will find it!"

17
00:01:15.914 --> 00:01:20.367
Bird got a pencil and paper.

18
00:01:20.368 --> 00:01:23.435
She wrote a note.

19
00:01:23.436 --> 00:01:28.090
She put it into the bottle.

20
00:01:28.091 --> 00:01:41.811
Then she left the bottle in the pond.

21
00:01:41.812 --> 00:01:45.622
The next morning Kip saw the bottle.

22
00:01:45.623 --> 00:01:48.550
"That's strange," he said.

23
00:01:48.551 --> 00:01:51.816
"There's something in that bottle!"

